# The measured evidence the code cites by name. A comment that says
# "measured on 120 labelled frames" is worth nothing if the 120 frames'
# labels are not in the repo beside it.
# ...and the scripts that DRIVE the tool. The repo held the instrument
# and not the way it is played: build.sh and install.sh have run every
# build of this note and were never once committed.
# git will not descend into an excluded DIRECTORY, so the folder has to be
# re-included before any rule about the files inside it can bite.
!_probe/pixfirst-test/
_probe/pixfirst-test/*
!_probe/pixfirst-test/*.sh
!_probe/pixfirst-test/*.py
!_probe/pixfirst-test/truth.json
!_probe/screen_truth.json
!_probe/confirmed.json
!_probe/glyphwidth.json
_bak/
_bigwin/
_cmp*/
_*cmp/
_compare_out/
*.txt
*.log
*.pyc
